    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Element 1 of the CUREE-CALTECH Woodframe Project was devoted to Testing and Analysis, and for almost all\r\nthe 23 individual investigations in this Element, a Literature Review task was required. This report compiles\r\nthose reviews into a one-volume reference document.\r\n\r\nTask 1.1.1 - Shake Table Tests of a Simplified Two-Story Single Family House\r\nD. Fischer, A. Filiatrault, C.-M. Uang, and F. Seible\r\n\r\nTask 1.3.1 - Loading Protocol and Loading Rate Effects\r\nK. Gatto and C.-M. Uang\r\n\r\nTask 1.3.3 - Dynamic Characteristics of Woodframe Buildings\r\nJ. Beck and Camelo\r\n\r\nTask 1.4.1.1 - Anchorage of Woodframe Buildings\r\nJ. Mahaney and B. Kehoe\r\n\r\nTask 1.4.1.2 - Experimental Program to Study Anchorage of Hillside Woodframe Buildings\r\nY. Xiao and L. Xie\r\n\r\nTask 1.4.2 - Preliminary Literature Review of Wood Diaphragms\r\nJ. Bott, J. Dolan, and W. Easterling\r\n\r\nTask 1.4.3 - Seismic Behavior of Cripple Walls\r\nY.H. Chai, S. Berton, and S.M. Vukazich\r\n\r\nTask 1.4.4 - Shear Walls\r\nG. Pardoen, E. Freund, N. Shah and A. Smith\r\n\r\nTask 1.4.6 - Seismic Performance of Gypsum and Stucco Walls\r\nK. McMullin, G. Deierlein, D. Merrick, and J. Osteraas\r\n\r\nTask 1.4.7 - Innovative Systems for Seismic Protection of Wood Structures\r\nM. Symans\r\n\r\nTask 1.4.8.1 - Effect of Fastener Head Penetration on Sheathing-to-Wood Connections\r\nJ. Rabe and F. Fonseca\r\n\r\nTask 1.4.8.2 - Inter-Story Shear Transfer in Woodframe Buildings\r\nT. Ryan, K. Fridley, D. Pollock and R. Itani",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
